stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> APPLIED: EXECUTE, handler applies
    [*] --> REJECTED: EXECUTE, handler rejects
    [*] --> ABORTED: COMPENSATE before EXECUTE (tombstone)
    APPLIED --> COMPENSATED: COMPENSATE, handler undoes
    APPLIED --> APPLIED: EXECUTE again, replay DONE
    REJECTED --> REJECTED: EXECUTE again, replay REJECTED
    ABORTED --> ABORTED: late EXECUTE, reply REJECTED, no effect
    COMPENSATED --> COMPENSATED: COMPENSATE again, replay DONE
